# Bien moi truong cho tro ly AI cua BRIDGE.
#
# Chep file nay thanh `.dev.vars` (khong co duoi .example) roi dien gia tri that.
# `.dev.vars` la chuan cua Cloudflare Workers cho local dev; no da nam trong .gitignore.
# Khi deploy: dat cac bien nay trong Settings -> Variables and Secrets cua Worker.
#
#   cp .dev.vars.example .dev.vars
#   pnpm dev
#
# Khong bao gio commit `.dev.vars`, va khong bao gio dat API key trong code chay o trinh duyet.

# BAT BUOC de tro ly tra loi bang AI. Lay tai https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# Thieu bien nay: app van chay, nhung chi tim bang tu khoa + tra loi mau.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# TUY CHON: doi danh sach model. De trong thi dung mac dinh trong lib/assistant/config.ts
# (model manh truoc, model nhe lam du phong). Ghi nhieu model, cach nhau dau phay.
# GEMINI_MODELS=gemini-3.5-flash-lite,gemini-flash-lite-latest
# AI_NLU_MODELS=
# AI_RERANK_MODELS=
# AI_ANSWER_MODELS=

# TUY CHON: bo buoc rerank cho nhanh hon (doi lai kem chinh xac hon).
# AI_SKIP_RERANK=1

# TUY CHON: chay toan bo luong ma khong goi Gemini. Dung de thu giao dien khi chua co key.
# RAG_FAKE_GEMINI=1

# TUY CHON: tra cuu ABN truc tiep tu Australian Business Register.
# Dang ky mien phi tai https://abr.business.gov.au/Tools/WebServices
# Thieu bien nay: app bo qua buoc tra ABN, cac buoc khac van chay binh thuong.
ABN_LOOKUP_GUID=
